	<#bbbbbb>This move list assumes you are facing to the right.</>

	<#0f43ff>UNIQUE TRAIT: ONLY ONE</>
	One's Remix Moves make him throw his sword, and he can pick it back up
	by using Remix Moves or specific Special Moves while standing near it.
	He can kick his sword out of the air by using his jumping Heavy attacks.
	Additionally, One can airdash cancel his Normal moves on hit.

	<#24ff24>SWORD UNIQUE MOVES</>
HIGH KICK	-		<#65b5ff>(AIR ONLY)</> ^A_-^A
LOW KICK	-		_D^A_-^A
VERTICAL	-		_B^B
SWEEP	-		_DF^C
SPIKE	-		<#65b5ff>(AIR ONLY)</> _D^C

	<#0f43ff>SWORDLESS UNIQUE MOVES</>
